@group(:concurrency)
mod Std.ExitReason
  ## Typed reasons understood by Cure's safe process APIs. `Because` is the
  ## deliberate raw-atom escape hatch for application- and OTP-specific
  ## reasons; callers do not need to abandon the typed API to use one.
  type ExitReason = Normal | Kill | Shutdown | Because(Atom)

  ## Private-boundary encoding is repeated by the process modules so the Atom
  ## representation never becomes the public result of a safe operation.
